# Emergency and Ambulance Patient Flow

## 0. Overview

This file is the direct Emergency flow source of truth for HOSSPI HMS. The **emergency case** is the hub while the patient is in the emergency department. Emergency hands off to OPD, IPD, ICU, or Theater without duplicating downstream encounters. Align with [`.cursor/flows/opd-flow.mdc`](./opd-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/ipd-flow.mdc`](./ipd-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/icu-flow.mdc`](./icu-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/theater-flow.mdc`](./theater-flow.mdc), and [`.cursor/app-write-up.mdc`](../app-write-up.mdc).

## 1. Goal

Enable emergency clinicians, triage nurses, and ambulance dispatchers to run acute intake end-to-end: quick registration, triage, stabilization, ambulance dispatch, emergency response documentation, and **handoff** to receiving workflows â" with care-before-billing affordances and source context preserved on all downstream modules.

### Central encounter rule

While active, the emergency case owns the workflow. Handoff creates or reuses the receiving record (OPD flow, IPD admission, ICU stay, theater case) and links `emergency_case_id`. Emergency does not own inpatient bed management, OPD consultation queues, or cashier workflows after handoff.

---

## 2. Position in the Patient Journey

Emergency sits **at the front** of the journey and branches to downstream flows.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    ARR[Arrival / ambulance / walk-in] --> CASE[Emergency case OPEN]
    CASE --> TRIAGE[Triage + stabilize]
    TRIAGE --> HO{Handoff destination}
    HO -->|OPD| OPD[opd-flow â" WAITING_VITALS]
    HO -->|IPD| IPD[ipd-flow â" admission]
    HO -->|ICU| ICU[ipd-flow + icu-flow]
    HO -->|THEATER| OT[theater-flow]
    HO -->|REFERRAL / DISCHARGE| CLOSE[Case closed]
    OPD --> OPD_ADMIT[ADMITTED â' IPD]
```

| Downstream | Flow reference | Emergency responsibility |
| ---------- | -------------- | ------------------------ |
| OPD | [opd-flow Â§2](./opd-flow.mdc) | `destination=OPD`; `arrival_mode=EMERGENCY`; payment gate waived when policy allows |
| IPD | [ipd-flow Â§2.1](./ipd-flow.mdc) | `destination=IPD`; `Billing Deferred` when urgent |
| ICU | [icu-flow Â§4.1](./icu-flow.mdc) | `destination=ICU`; IPD + `start-icu-stay` |
| Theater | [theater-flow Â§4.2](./theater-flow.mdc) | `destination=THEATER`; theatre case started |
| Patient registry | [app-write-up](../app-write-up.mdc) | Quick arrival may create incomplete patient â" complete later |

